rly adept at that skill.</em></p><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You get a +3 bonus on all checks involving the chosen skill. If you have 10 or more ranks in that skill, this bonus increases to +6.</p><p><strong>Special</strong>: You can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, it applies to a new skill.</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["General"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[{"_id":"TciZzVFN","formula":"ifelse(gte(@skills.per.rank,10),6,3)","target":"skill.per","type":"untyped","operator":"add","priority":0}],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"feat","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"na","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{}},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":712500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf-content.pf-feats.Item.9yua5ZlomvDj1c7D"},"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"qWGVh5UiUkQKKQGn","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795125096570,"modifiedTime":1795125098878,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/run.jpg","name":"Powerful Charge (Gore, 4D8+18)","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When a creature with this special attack charges, its attack deals extra damage in addition to the normal benefits and hazards of a charge. The attack and the damage from the attack are given in the creature’s description.</p><p><em>Format</em>: powerful charge (gore, 4d8+24)</p><p><em>Location</em>: Special Attacks.</p><p><em>Usage:</em> Replace damage</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Universal Monster Rules"],"actions":[{"_id":"s4azn518r8dp5nfy","ability":{"attack":"_default","damage":"str","critRange":20,"critMult":2},"actionType":"mwak","activation":{"type":"standard","unchained":{"cost":2,"type":"action"},"cost":1},"attackName":"Gore","damage":{"parts":[{"formula":"4d8+18"}]},"img":"systems/pf1/icons/feats/run.jpg","name":"Use","tag":"powerfulChargeEx","uses":{},"powerAttack":{"damageBonus":2,"critMultiplier":1},"notes":{"effect":[""]}}],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"misc","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"ex","associations":{"classes":[]},"showInQuickbar":false,"crOffset":"","inherited":false,"acquired":false,"simple":false,"summons":false,"disabled":false,"classSkills":{}},"type":"feat","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":612500,"flags":{"core":{"sourceId":"Compendium.pf-content.pf-universal-monster-rules.Item.7MyJ5teWASJfFwN6"},"pf1":{"migration":"11.11"}},"ownership":{"default":0}},{"_id":"w3SVbeNlpCentAKO","_stats":{"coreVersion":"13.351","systemId":"pf1","systemVersion":"11.11","createdTime":1795125096808,"modifiedTime":1795125098878,"lastModifiedBy":"C7TQ7ZOKBUpwNi2A"},"img":"icons/commodities/biological/foot-black-grey.webp","name":"Trample (2d6+13, DC 23)","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a full-round action, a creature with the trample ability can attempt to overrun any creature that is at least one size category smaller than itself. This works just like the overrun combat maneuver, but the trampling creature does not need to attempt a check; it merely has to move over opponents in its path. Targets of a trample take an amount of damage equal to the trampling creature’s slam damage + 1-1/2 times its Strength modifier. Targets of a trample can make an attack of opportunity, but at a –4 penalty. If a target forgoes an attack of opportunity, it can attempt a Reflex save to avoid the trampling creature and take half damage. The save DC against a creature’s trample attack is 10 + 1/2 the creature’s HD + the creature’s Strength modifier (the exact DC is given in the creature’s descriptive text). A trampling creature can only deal its trampling damage to each target once per round, no matter how many times its movement takes it over a target creature. A trampling creature can move up to twice its land speed as part of the trample.</p><p><em>Format</em>: trample (2d6+9, DC 20)</p><p><em>Location</em>: Special Attacks.</p><p><em>Usage:</em> Replace damage and DC</p>","instructions":""},"tags":["Universal Monster Rules"],"actions":[],"attackNotes":[],"effectNotes":[],"uses":{"value":null,"per":"","autoDeductChargesCost":"","maxFormula":"","rechargeFormula":""},"changes":[],"changeFlags":{"immuneToMorale":false,"loseDexToAC":false,"noMediumEncumbrance":false,"noHeavyEncumbrance":false,"mediumArmorFullSpeed":false,"heavyArmorFullSpeed":false,"lowLightVision":false,"seeInvisibility":false,"seeInDarkness":false},"contextNotes":[],"links":{"children":[],"charges":[],"supplements":[]},"tag":"","armorProf":[],"weaponProf":[],"languages":[],"flags":{"boolean":{},"dictionary":{}},"scriptCalls":[],"subType":"misc","traitType":"","traitCategory":"","racePoints":null,"abilityType":"ex","asso